  "Vi mätte 42 000 inkommande samtal hos nordiska restauranger. Toppen ligger 17:30–19:00 — exakt när ingen kan svara.": "We measured 42,000 incoming calls at Nordic restaurants. The peak is 17:30–19:00 — exactly when no one can answer.",
